@startuml Live Camera Stream
title Live Camera Stream via WebSocket

actor User
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "WebSocket" as WS
participant "API Backend" as API
participant "MQTT Broker" as MQTT
participant "ESP Camera" as ESP

User -> App: Open garden camera view
App -> WS: Establish WebSocket connection
WS -> API: Connection established

ESP -> MQTT: Publish frame to {mac}/device/camera/frame/{index}/#
MQTT -> API: Receive frame on topic
API -> API: Process JPEG frame
API -> API: Convert to base64
API -> WS: Send "camera_frame" event\n{timestamp, image_base64}
WS -> App: Forward camera_frame event
App -> App: Decode base64 image
App -> User: Display frame in real-time

note over ESP, App: Process repeats for continuous video stream

@enduml
